B.K9=s(["Node: A numbered work task in your assembly process (1, 2, 3, and so on).","Tek: The time required to finish a single task, entered as zero or a positive number.","Connection (From -> To): A precedence rule showing that the From task must finish before the To task can begin.","Final Node: The last task at the end of the precedence diagram where all paths finish.","Cycle Time: The maximum time allowed at each workstation to meet your production pace.","RPW: A task weight equal to its own Tek plus the Tek of every task reachable downstream from it.","Balance Delay: Percentage of idle time across all stations relative to total available station time.","Production Rate: Output capacity calculated as 1 divided by the highest station load."],t.s)
